# Added by the team (docs/agents/platform.md step 3). The template has no .gitattributes.
# LF everywhere, so that hashes and diffs are the same on macOS, Linux and Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Suva's material from the template is kept byte for byte (D-040): never converted,
# so that the judgements/ manifest and the pitch PDF hash hold on every machine.
judgements/** -text
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.parquet binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
